  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extra activities for international RBC agreement for TruStone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project &apos;Extra activities for international responsible business conduct (RBC) agreement for TruStone&apos;, Stichting Arisa, FNV, Stichting Actionaid, ACVBIE (Belgium trade union) contribute their knowledge and experience to support Dutch companies with implementing human resources (HR) due diligence during the implementation phase of the international RBC sector agreement for TruStone.Due to transparency with regard to the IATI projects, a non-ODA country is mentioned in this project.</narrative>
  </description>
